OL,3,GNEWSACity centre's Low and No bars are
OL,4,Aon the map
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of maps have been created
OL,7,Fhighlighting some of the pubs and bars
OL,8,Fin Hull that offer good selections of
OL,9,Flow and non-alcoholic drinks.
OL,11,FThe Low and No Alcohol Zones have been
OL,12,Fproduced in response to such drinks
OL,13,Fmore than doubling in popularity since
OL,14,F2020, Hull City Council said.
OL,16,FThey replace the Low Ale Trails, which
OL,17,Fwere also designed to make it easier
OL,18,Ffor people to find low and non-alcohol
OL,19,Foptions in the city.
